1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:02,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:38,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>JUJUTSU KAISEN</b></font>

3
00:01:31,430 --> 00:01:34,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] Nice to meet you,
child of Zen'in,</b></font>

4
00:01:34,090 --> 00:01:35,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Descendant of Michizane,</b></font>

5
00:01:35,850 --> 00:01:37,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cursed Womb Death Painting,</b></font>

6
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:39,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and Vessel of Sukuna.</b></font>

7
00:01:39,810 --> 00:01:43,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess you don't
have a greeting for me? Tengen.</b></font>

8
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUJI] So this...
-[MEGUMI] Thing.</b></font>

9
00:01:44,810 --> 00:01:45,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUTA] This person.
-[CHOSO] Person?</b></font>

10
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:47,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] It's Tengen?</b></font>

11
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:49,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] It's not
our first time meeting,</b></font>

12
00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:51,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuki Tsukumo.</b></font>

13
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:54,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me why you closed
the Tombs of the Star.</b></font>

14
00:01:55,450 --> 00:01:59,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] I was wary of you
being aligned with Kenjaku.</b></font>

15
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:02,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't tell what's going on
in people's hearts, after all.</b></font>

16
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] Kenjaku?</b></font>

17
00:02:05,580 --> 00:02:07,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What was once Noritoshi Kamo,</b></font>

18
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:11,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the sorcerer who's currently
inhabiting Suguru Geto's body.</b></font>

19
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:14,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A net of compassion
and a rope of salvation.</b></font>

20
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wasn't even trying for sarcasm.</b></font>

21
00:02:17,550 --> 00:02:19,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You look nothing like
how I pictured you, Tengen.</b></font>

22
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:23,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Ballsy to insert
himself into the conversation.</b></font>

23
00:02:23,850 --> 00:02:26,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just because I'm immortal
doesn't make me ageless.</b></font>

24
00:02:26,650 --> 00:02:29,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'd look like this too,
if you were 500 years old.</b></font>

25
00:02:29,570 --> 00:02:30,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Seriously?</b></font>

26
00:02:31,690 --> 00:02:33,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My aging has sped up</b></font>

27
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:35,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ever since I failed
to assimilate</b></font>

28
00:02:35,530 --> 00:02:38,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with the Star Plasma Vessel
12 years ago.</b></font>

29
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:41,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My identity as
an individual has vanished.</b></font>

30
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:43,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now you can consider
my existence</b></font>

31
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as the world itself.</b></font>

32
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] So there wasn't
actually another</b></font>

33
00:02:46,830 --> 00:02:48,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Star Plasma Vessel back then?</b></font>

34
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That explains
why there isn't a new voice.</b></font>

35
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:54,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Excuse me.</b></font>

36
00:02:54,550 --> 00:02:57,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We came here
to learn Kenjaku's goal.</b></font>

37
00:02:57,220 --> 00:03:00,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And also to learn about
how to open the Prison Realm.</b></font>

38
00:03:00,060 --> 00:03:02,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could you tell us
what you know about it?</b></font>

39
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:05,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] Of course.</b></font>

40
00:03:05,390 --> 00:03:07,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I must impose
one condition first,</b></font>

41
00:03:07,730 --> 00:03:09,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and it's non-negotiable.</b></font>

42
00:03:09,690 --> 00:03:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuta Okkotsu,</b></font>

43
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:12,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuki Tsukumo,</b></font>

44
00:03:12,530 --> 00:03:14,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the Cursed Womb
Death Painting.</b></font>

45
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:18,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll need two of you three
to remain behind here.</b></font>

46
00:03:18,370 --> 00:03:20,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Remain behind and guard me.</b></font>

47
00:03:20,530 --> 00:03:22,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Megumi gasps]
-Guard you?</b></font>

48
00:03:22,410 --> 00:03:23,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You said you're immortal.</b></font>

49
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you afraid
of being sealed or something?</b></font>

50
00:03:26,210 --> 00:03:28,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] That isn't fair!</b></font>

51
00:03:28,290 --> 00:03:30,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Without telling us
why or how long</b></font>

52
00:03:30,210 --> 00:03:31,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we're guarding you.</b></font>

53
00:03:39,010 --> 00:03:40,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In that case...</b></font>

54
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:45,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let me speak of Kenjaku.</b></font>

55
00:03:45,810 --> 00:03:46,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>KENJAKU'S OBJECTIVE</b></font>

56
00:03:46,850 --> 00:03:48,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That man's objective</b></font>

57
00:03:48,770 --> 00:03:51,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is to force the evolution
of mankind</b></font>

58
00:03:51,650 --> 00:03:53,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>throughout all of Japan.</b></font>

59
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>THE EVOLUTION OF MANKIND
THROUGHOUT ALL JAPAN</b></font>

60
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I heard about that.</b></font>

61
00:03:56,570 --> 00:03:58,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But how does he
actually intend to do it?</b></font>

62
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:01,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And why didn't Kenjaku</b></font>

63
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>use your barriers
back when he could...</b></font>

64
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IDLE TRANSFIGURATION</b></font>

65
00:04:04,540 --> 00:04:06,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>...to turn everyone in Japan
into jujutsu sorcerers</b></font>

66
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:08,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with Idle Transfiguration?</b></font>

67
00:04:08,370 --> 00:04:09,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IDLE TRANSFIGURATION</b></font>

68
00:04:09,670 --> 00:04:10,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>THE EVOLUTION OF MANKIND
THROUGHOUT ALL JAPAN</b></font>

69
00:04:10,380 --> 00:04:11,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] For a simple reason.</b></font>

70
00:04:11,790 --> 00:04:14,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He lacked the cursed energy
to do so.</b></font>

71
00:04:14,550 --> 00:04:16,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The cursed energy
refined through Maelstrom</b></font>

72
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>can't return to the sorcerer.</b></font>

73
00:04:18,930 --> 00:04:21,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Besides, a cursed technique
involving people one at a time</b></font>

74
00:04:21,930 --> 00:04:23,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is far too inefficient.</b></font>

75
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:26,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So Kenjaku's
new method of evolution</b></font>

76
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:29,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is to assimilate
mankind with me.</b></font>

77
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:30,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>HOW?
ASSIMILATE MANKIND WITH TENGEN</b></font>

78
00:04:33,650 --> 00:04:35,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But wait.
I thought your assimilation--</b></font>

79
00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:38,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Should only be possible
with the Star Plasma Vessel.</b></font>

80
00:04:38,610 --> 00:04:40,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TENGEN - ORDINARY PERSON
ASSIMILATION IMPOSSIBLE</b></font>

81
00:04:40,490 --> 00:04:42,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Previously, that was true.</b></font>

82
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>STAR PLASMA VESSEL'S DEATH</b></font>

83
00:04:43,530 --> 00:04:44,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ASSIMILATION WITH THE STAR
PLASMA VESSEL PREVENTED</b></font>

84
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:47,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But since I started evolving
12 years ago...</b></font>

85
00:04:47,250 --> 00:04:49,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TENGEN'S EVOLUTION</b></font>

86
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>...assimilation with someone</b></font>

87
00:04:51,330 --> 00:04:53,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>other than
the Star Plasma Vessel</b></font>

88
00:04:53,250 --> 00:04:54,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is possible.</b></font>

89
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:55,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ASSIMILATE MANKIND WITH TENGEN</b></font>

90
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even so, you're only one person.</b></font>

91
00:04:58,380 --> 00:05:01,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He still can't assimilate
with multiple people at once.</b></font>

92
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:02,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] Wrong.</b></font>

93
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right now, the image
you are seeing of me</b></font>

94
00:05:04,350 --> 00:05:06,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is not my actual self.</b></font>

95
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:07,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now that I've evolved,</b></font>

96
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my soul is
everywhere all the time.</b></font>

97
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:14,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like I said before, the world
itself is who I am now.</b></font>

98
00:05:14,190 --> 00:05:15,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People who assimilated with me</b></font>

99
00:05:15,770 --> 00:05:18,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would become something
more than a sorcerer.</b></font>

100
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They'd become a new creature</b></font>

101
00:05:19,860 --> 00:05:22,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that at the same time
is both there and not there.</b></font>

102
00:05:22,530 --> 00:05:24,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is because of
my barrier techniques</b></font>

103
00:05:24,370 --> 00:05:26,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that I was able to
retain my shape and reason</b></font>

104
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:28,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after I started evolving.</b></font>

105
00:05:28,410 --> 00:05:31,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, if mankind were
to begin evolving,</b></font>

106
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:34,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even if only one person
went out of control...</b></font>

107
00:05:34,460 --> 00:05:35,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>OUT OF CONTROL</b></font>

108
00:05:35,590 --> 00:05:37,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-...the world would end.
-[YUKI] Why?</b></font>

109
00:05:37,460 --> 00:05:40,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] There would be no
boundaries between individuals.</b></font>

110
00:05:40,590 --> 00:05:42,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Evil would spread
to all instantly.</b></font>

111
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:45,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The impurities
of 100 million people</b></font>

112
00:05:45,050 --> 00:05:46,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would flood the world.</b></font>

113
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What happened in Tokyo</b></font>

114
00:05:47,810 --> 00:05:50,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would be recreated
on a worldwide scale.</b></font>

115
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:52,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What would make him
wanna do something like that?</b></font>

116
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:55,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] That, I do not know.</b></font>

117
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:58,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As I said, there's no telling
what's inside people's hearts.</b></font>

118
00:05:58,780 --> 00:06:00,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>WHY?
UNKNOWN</b></font>

119
00:06:00,570 --> 00:06:01,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If that's the case,</b></font>

120
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:03,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as long as you
reject the assimilation,</b></font>

121
00:06:03,860 --> 00:06:05,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>won't everything be fine?</b></font>

122
00:06:05,490 --> 00:06:07,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now we're getting
to why I need guarding.</b></font>

123
00:06:07,990 --> 00:06:09,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Since I have evolved,</b></font>

124
00:06:09,330 --> 00:06:11,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my nature is closer to that
of a cursed spirit</b></font>

125
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:14,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than it is to that
of a human being.</b></font>

126
00:06:14,250 --> 00:06:18,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I can be targeted
by Cursed Spirit Manipulation.</b></font>

127
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:20,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

128
00:06:21,670 --> 00:06:24,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Considering Kenjaku's
enormous strength as a sorcerer,</b></font>

129
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:26,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would likely be absorbed</b></font>

130
00:06:26,180 --> 00:06:28,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the moment he made
contact with me.</b></font>

131
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:31,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why my main body
is rejecting everything</b></font>

132
00:06:31,470 --> 00:06:33,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the Tombs of the Star
right now.</b></font>

133
00:06:34,230 --> 00:06:35,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why you need guarding?</b></font>

134
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Correct.</b></font>

135
00:06:37,690 --> 00:06:39,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kenjaku is second
only to me in his skill</b></font>

136
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:40,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with barrier techniques.</b></font>

137
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:42,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know when he'll
manage to break the seal</b></font>

138
00:06:42,820 --> 00:06:44,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on the Tombs of the Star.</b></font>

139
00:06:44,990 --> 00:06:46,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why is this happening now?</b></font>

140
00:06:46,490 --> 00:06:48,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Star Plasma Vessel
assimilation failed.</b></font>

141
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:50,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've been forced to evolve,</b></font>

142
00:06:50,540 --> 00:06:53,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so he wants to absorb you
with Cursed Energy Manipulation.</b></font>

143
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:56,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It also seems Kenjaku
has connections to Sukuna.</b></font>

144
00:06:56,920 --> 00:07:00,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which means he's been a sorcerer
for at least 1,000 years.</b></font>

145
00:07:01,210 --> 00:07:03,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So then, why now?</b></font>

146
00:07:03,590 --> 00:07:06,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because myself,
the Star Plasma Vessel,</b></font>

147
00:07:06,130 --> 00:07:07,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the Six Eyes</b></font>

148
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:10,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are all connected by fate
and intertwined with each other.</b></font>

149
00:07:10,970 --> 00:07:11,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TENGEN - STAR PLASMA VESSEL
SIX EYES</b></font>

150
00:07:12,350 --> 00:07:14,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Twice in the past,
Kenjaku was stopped</b></font>

151
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:16,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by the sorcerer
with the Six Eyes.</b></font>

152
00:07:16,310 --> 00:07:17,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The second time,
he was thorough.</b></font>

153
00:07:17,850 --> 00:07:19,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He killed both
the Star Plasma Vessel</b></font>

154
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:21,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the bearer of the Six Eyes</b></font>

155
00:07:21,150 --> 00:07:22,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>within a month of their birth.</b></font>

156
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:25,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Despite that, the Six Eyes
and the Star Plasma Vessel</b></font>

157
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:28,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>still appeared by the day
of my assimilation.</b></font>

158
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:31,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After that, Kenjaku
altered his strategy</b></font>

159
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:33,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to focus on sealing the Six Eyes
instead of killing him,</b></font>

160
00:07:33,910 --> 00:07:36,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as he began searching
for the Prison Realm.</b></font>

161
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:38,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After all,
there can't be two people</b></font>

162
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:40,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with the Six Eyes
at the same time.</b></font>

163
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, 12 years ago,</b></font>

164
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:44,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>something
unpredictable happened.</b></font>

165
00:07:44,380 --> 00:07:46,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Toji Zen'in intervened.</b></font>

166
00:07:46,170 --> 00:07:47,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>UNPREDICTED EVENT
TOJI ZEN'IN INTERVENES</b></font>

167
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:50,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He was physically gifted
through a Heavenly Pact.</b></font>

168
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:51,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And he was unique among them</b></font>

169
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:54,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for being completely free
from cursed energy.</b></font>

170
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:56,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] Mm.</b></font>

171
00:07:56,180 --> 00:07:57,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Hmm.</b></font>

172
00:07:57,810 --> 00:08:00,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] Since his Heavenly Pact
placed him outside of fate,</b></font>

173
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:03,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he decided to destroy
the very fate that connected us.</b></font>

174
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>STAR PLASMA VESSEL'S DEATH</b></font>

175
00:08:04,530 --> 00:08:05,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then, a young man with the power</b></font>

176
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:08,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of Cursed Spirit Manipulation
appeared.</b></font>

177
00:08:08,700 --> 00:08:11,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Without even trying, he now had
all the necessary pieces</b></font>

178
00:08:11,570 --> 00:08:13,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>except for the Prison Realm.</b></font>

179
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>CURSED SPIRIT MANIPULATION
STAR PLASMA VESSEL'S DEATH</b></font>

180
00:08:14,490 --> 00:08:16,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, six years ago,</b></font>

181
00:08:16,330 --> 00:08:19,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Prison Realm made its way
into Kenjaku's hands, as well.</b></font>

182
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:20,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>PRISON REALM</b></font>

183
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If Kenjaku has the Prison Realm,</b></font>

184
00:08:22,540 --> 00:08:24,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then why is
this Culling Game being hosted?</b></font>

185
00:08:25,170 --> 00:08:27,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a warm-up
before assimilation.</b></font>

186
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My assimilation with people</b></font>

187
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:31,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>other than the Star
Plasma Vessel is possible.</b></font>

188
00:08:31,890 --> 00:08:33,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But at the moment,
there's a high probability</b></font>

189
00:08:33,930 --> 00:08:36,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it will result in
something incomplete.</b></font>

190
00:08:36,810 --> 00:08:39,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Culling Game uses
the cursed energy of the players</b></font>

191
00:08:40,020 --> 00:08:42,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the boundaries
formed between the Colonies,</b></font>

192
00:08:42,690 --> 00:08:45,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in a ritual
to send this nation's people</b></font>

193
00:08:45,110 --> 00:08:46,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the other side.</b></font>

194
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:49,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He probably plans
to use that as a warm-up</b></font>

195
00:08:49,150 --> 00:08:51,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to start their assimilation
with me.</b></font>

196
00:08:51,370 --> 00:08:52,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>MANKIND - TENGEN
THE CULLING GAME - WARM-UP</b></font>

197
00:08:52,530 --> 00:08:54,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However,
to establish that ritual,</b></font>

198
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:56,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kenjaku should've been forced</b></font>

199
00:08:56,790 --> 00:08:58,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to accept several pacts.</b></font>

200
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:04,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One of those pacts
is that Kenjaku is not allowed</b></font>

201
00:09:04,670 --> 00:09:07,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to name himself
the Culling Game's Game Master.</b></font>

202
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unfortunately, that's
a disadvantage to you as well.</b></font>

203
00:09:10,430 --> 00:09:15,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because it means that killing
Kenjaku won't end the game.</b></font>

204
00:09:15,430 --> 00:09:17,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Either all of the players
must die,</b></font>

205
00:09:17,810 --> 00:09:20,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or the players must all refuse
to participate and die.</b></font>

206
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:22,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The rules specifically mention</b></font>

207
00:09:22,940 --> 00:09:24,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that nothing must
significantly hinder</b></font>

208
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:27,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the continuation
of the Culling Game.</b></font>

209
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:29,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>An insurance policy
to prevent the ritual</b></font>

210
00:09:29,570 --> 00:09:31,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from being stopped.</b></font>

211
00:09:31,070 --> 00:09:32,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In that case...</b></font>

212
00:09:32,110 --> 00:09:33,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, right.</b></font>

213
00:09:35,410 --> 00:09:37,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All of us need to participate
in the Culling Game.</b></font>

214
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:40,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And add a rule that creates
a way out of the game</b></font>

215
00:09:40,620 --> 00:09:43,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for Tsumiki and those
reluctant to participate.</b></font>

216
00:09:45,250 --> 00:09:47,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We need to free Gojo Sensei
at the same time.</b></font>

217
00:09:48,130 --> 00:09:50,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He could resolve this all
entirely on his own.</b></font>

218
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:52,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ITADORI'S FRIENDS' OBJECTIVE</b></font>

219
00:09:52,510 --> 00:09:54,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>CREATE A RULE
TO ESCAPE THE CULLING GAME</b></font>

220
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:55,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>FREE SATORU GOJO</b></font>

221
00:09:55,590 --> 00:09:57,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, what do we do next?</b></font>

222
00:09:57,180 --> 00:10:00,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First, please decide
which of you will stay behind.</b></font>

223
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI, CHOSO] I'll do it.</b></font>

224
00:10:02,270 --> 00:10:03,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll stay.</b></font>

225
00:10:03,310 --> 00:10:04,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI, MEGUMI] Huh?</b></font>

226
00:10:04,650 --> 00:10:06,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuji, you are absolutely
going to need the help</b></font>

227
00:10:06,570 --> 00:10:08,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of either Okkotsu
or that woman,</b></font>

228
00:10:08,860 --> 00:10:10,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Noritoshi Kamo.</b></font>

229
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:12,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If Kenjaku comes,
that's all the more reason</b></font>

230
00:10:12,530 --> 00:10:13,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for me to guard Tengen.</b></font>

231
00:10:14,570 --> 00:10:16,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I must do so because
slaying him would mean</b></font>

232
00:10:16,820 --> 00:10:18,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>saving my younger brothers.</b></font>

233
00:10:18,490 --> 00:10:21,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] I'm still not finished
talking with Tengen just yet.</b></font>

234
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:24,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does that sound okay, Okkotsu?</b></font>

235
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:27,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I don't wanna be
separated from everyone anymore.</b></font>

236
00:10:30,590 --> 00:10:31,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

237
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now this.</b></font>

238
00:10:37,050 --> 00:10:39,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the Back
of the Prison Realm.</b></font>

239
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:42,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you plan to free Satoru Gojo,</b></font>

240
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll need it.</b></font>

241
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:45,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The back?</b></font>

242
00:10:45,310 --> 00:10:46,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First I've heard of it.</b></font>

243
00:10:46,730 --> 00:10:48,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like a back door?</b></font>

244
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's right.</b></font>

245
00:10:49,650 --> 00:10:51,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Before Kenjaku found it,</b></font>

246
00:10:51,530 --> 00:10:54,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Prison Realm was
outside of my barriers.</b></font>

247
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Probably somewhere abroad.</b></font>

248
00:10:57,450 --> 00:10:59,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought
keeping this Back sealed</b></font>

249
00:10:59,330 --> 00:11:01,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would obscure
the presence of the Front,</b></font>

250
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:02,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it didn't work.</b></font>

251
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:07,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Satoru Gojo is also sealed away
within this back gate.</b></font>

252
00:11:07,580 --> 00:11:10,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What? Then let's open it
and let him out!</b></font>

253
00:11:10,090 --> 00:11:12,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] No,
the authority to open the gates</b></font>

254
00:11:12,510 --> 00:11:14,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>rests with the owner
of the Front.</b></font>

255
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kenjaku.</b></font>

256
00:11:15,930 --> 00:11:17,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In order to break this one open,</b></font>

257
00:11:18,010 --> 00:11:20,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you need either
the Inverted Spear of Heaven</b></font>

258
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:23,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that can force the cancellation
of cursed techniques,</b></font>

259
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:25,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or something
that can disrupt and cancel out</b></font>

260
00:11:25,190 --> 00:11:27,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the effects of
a cursed technique.</b></font>

261
00:11:27,350 --> 00:11:29,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Black Rope could do it.</b></font>

262
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:33,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, 12 years ago,
Satoru Gojo either sealed</b></font>

263
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:37,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Inverted Spear of Heaven
abroad or destroyed it.</b></font>

264
00:11:37,570 --> 00:11:39,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ugh! Why would you
do that, Sensei?</b></font>

265
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:41,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN]
And last year, the black rope</b></font>

266
00:11:41,330 --> 00:11:43,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was also completely
frayed by Gojo.</b></font>

267
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:45,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ugh! What was he thinking?</b></font>

268
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

269
00:11:47,750 --> 00:11:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reminds me of Miguel.</b></font>

270
00:11:49,290 --> 00:11:50,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We went to Africa</b></font>

271
00:11:50,540 --> 00:11:52,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>looking for some more
of that Black Rope.</b></font>

272
00:11:52,670 --> 00:11:54,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So that's where you were.</b></font>

273
00:11:54,210 --> 00:11:55,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please tell me you found it.</b></font>

274
00:11:56,130 --> 00:11:58,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, but it was
a complete waste of effort.</b></font>

275
00:11:58,300 --> 00:12:01,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>- They said it's all gone.
- Huh?</b></font>

276
00:12:01,300 --> 00:12:02,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is there another way?</b></font>

277
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] There is.</b></font>

278
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:07,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Among the players participating
in the upcoming Culling Game,</b></font>

279
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:10,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's a sorcerer
from 1,000 years ago</b></font>

280
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:12,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who calls herself "Angel."</b></font>

281
00:12:12,190 --> 00:12:19,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ANGEL</b></font>

282
00:12:19,570 --> 00:12:21,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her cursed technique
can extinguish</b></font>

283
00:12:21,910 --> 00:12:23,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>any other cursed technique.</b></font>

284
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:27,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>HANA KURUSU</b></font>

285
00:12:27,830 --> 00:12:30,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 50
ABOUT THE CULLING GAME</b></font>

286
00:12:31,460 --> 00:12:34,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Extinguish
any cursed technique?</b></font>

287
00:12:34,550 --> 00:12:35,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] Yes.</b></font>

288
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:38,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And Angel's cursed technique
also has the power</b></font>

289
00:12:38,170 --> 00:12:40,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to open the Back
of the Prison Realm.</b></font>

290
00:12:41,010 --> 00:12:43,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can you tell us
where she is right now?</b></font>

291
00:12:43,510 --> 00:12:46,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's in the Colony
on the east side of Tokyo.</b></font>

292
00:12:46,470 --> 00:12:48,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The barriers
of the Culling Game reject me.</b></font>

293
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:51,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm afraid I don't have
any more information than that.</b></font>

294
00:12:51,230 --> 00:12:52,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

295
00:12:56,900 --> 00:12:59,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] Let's start
going over things from there.</b></font>

296
00:12:59,610 --> 00:13:02,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are 10 Colonies
across Japan.</b></font>

297
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They are linked together
by barriers</b></font>

298
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:07,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>designed to ferry the country's
people over to the other side.</b></font>

299
00:13:07,790 --> 00:13:09,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AKARI] Crossing a river
or other border,</b></font>

300
00:13:09,410 --> 00:13:11,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>acts that symbolize
crossing over to the afterlife,</b></font>

301
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:14,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>these carry important
meanings in sorcery.</b></font>

302
00:13:14,420 --> 00:13:16,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh. It's like
with Yasohachi Bridge!</b></font>

303
00:13:16,710 --> 00:13:17,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>YASOHACHI BRIDGE'S RIVER
OTHER SIDE - COLONIES' BARRIERS</b></font>

304
00:13:31,770 --> 00:13:34,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Jujutsu Society's barrier?</b></font>

305
00:13:34,230 --> 00:13:36,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, is Hokkaido excluded?</b></font>

306
00:13:36,110 --> 00:13:37,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] It is.</b></font>

307
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:41,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That land is already established
as a vast sacred ground.</b></font>

308
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:43,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess that's
"the challenging land" for you.</b></font>

309
00:13:44,370 --> 00:13:46,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN]
"Ferry them to the other side"</b></font>

310
00:13:46,490 --> 00:13:48,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>may sound a bit dramatic,</b></font>

311
00:13:48,410 --> 00:13:50,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but everyone in Japan was cursed</b></font>

312
00:13:50,290 --> 00:13:53,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in preparation
for the upcoming assimilation.</b></font>

313
00:13:58,630 --> 00:14:00,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>WARM-UP COMPLETE
THE CULLING GAME</b></font>

314
00:14:00,510 --> 00:14:01,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
Tell me about this ritual.</b></font>

315
00:14:01,920 --> 00:14:03,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How long will it take
to complete?</b></font>

316
00:14:04,010 --> 00:14:05,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Depends on the Culling Game.</b></font>

317
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My guess, it's over
in two months.</b></font>

318
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:10,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>1: PLAYERS MUST GO TO A COLONY
WITHIN 19 DAYS</b></font>

319
00:14:10,810 --> 00:14:11,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>AND PLEDGE THEIR PARTICIPATION
IN THE CULLING GAME.</b></font>

320
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:14,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is currently 9:00 a.m.
on the 9th of November.</b></font>

321
00:14:14,690 --> 00:14:17,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nine days since the players
awakened as sorcerers,</b></font>

322
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:20,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>which happened October 31st,
around midnight.</b></font>

323
00:14:20,780 --> 00:14:23,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That gives us about 10 days
and 15 hours to go</b></font>

324
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:26,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before Tsumiki's forced to play.</b></font>

325
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:27,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>REMAINING TIME UNTIL TSUMIKI
MUST ENTER THE CULLING GAME</b></font>

326
00:14:27,990 --> 00:14:30,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>OBTAIN 100 POINTS AND ADD A RULE
ALLOWING PEOPLE TO ESCAPE.</b></font>

327
00:14:31,910 --> 00:14:33,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>2: PLAYERS BREACHING RULE SHALL
BE STRIPPED OF THEIR TECHNIQUE.</b></font>

328
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:35,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tengen, you said before</b></font>

329
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:37,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that people would die
if they refused to participate.</b></font>

330
00:14:37,420 --> 00:14:38,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's right.</b></font>

331
00:14:39,340 --> 00:14:41,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They get stripped
of their technique, huh?</b></font>

332
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:43,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I believe that rule also applies</b></font>

333
00:14:43,090 --> 00:14:45,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to any sorcerers
joining in later.</b></font>

334
00:14:45,970 --> 00:14:48,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If that's the case,
the stripping isn't being done</b></font>

335
00:14:48,430 --> 00:14:51,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by Idle Transfiguration.</b></font>

336
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:52,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not a pact either.</b></font>

337
00:14:52,930 --> 00:14:55,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because it says "stripped,"
not "prohibited."</b></font>

338
00:14:55,650 --> 00:14:58,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]
So that probably means</b></font>

339
00:14:58,060 --> 00:15:01,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it'll be doing something
to the brain by force.</b></font>

340
00:15:01,110 --> 00:15:04,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And it's better for the rules if
being stripped means death, too.</b></font>

341
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:07,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Otherwise, everyone
would refuse to participate.</b></font>

342
00:15:07,660 --> 00:15:09,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's just as Shoko anticipated.</b></font>

343
00:15:10,030 --> 00:15:11,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that also means
there's no risk</b></font>

344
00:15:11,950 --> 00:15:14,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to sorcerers without any
cursed technique like me.</b></font>

345
00:15:15,290 --> 00:15:17,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And what'll happen to Panda?</b></font>

346
00:15:17,250 --> 00:15:18,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does he even have a brain?</b></font>

347
00:15:20,210 --> 00:15:22,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>3: NON-PLAYERS SHALL BECOME
PLAYERS UPON ENTERING A COLONY</b></font>

348
00:15:22,550 --> 00:15:23,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>About this rule,</b></font>

349
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:25,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what does it mean
for the ordinary people</b></font>

350
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who are in the Colony
from the start?</b></font>

351
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:29,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It means anyone who wants</b></font>

352
00:15:29,430 --> 00:15:31,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>will be granted at least
one chance to leave.</b></font>

353
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For real?</b></font>

354
00:15:33,100 --> 00:15:34,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How awfully generous.</b></font>

355
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:37,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] There are
no stipulations in the rules</b></font>

356
00:15:37,650 --> 00:15:40,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about leaving
or entering Colonies.</b></font>

357
00:15:40,190 --> 00:15:42,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They were probably trying
to stimulate the Culling Game</b></font>

358
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:45,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by giving players
a clear first-time goal</b></font>

359
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:48,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of leaving the Colony
with their lives intact.</b></font>

360
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:51,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In order to keep the players
inside for the duration,</b></font>

361
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:54,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the premise that players entered
of their own free will</b></font>

362
00:15:54,250 --> 00:15:56,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is extremely important.</b></font>

363
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:58,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ino mentioned that thing about
adjusting the barrier strength.</b></font>

364
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:01,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>4: PLAYERS WILL RECEIVE POINTS</b></font>

365
00:16:01,750 --> 00:16:04,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>UPON ENDING THE LIFE
OF ANOTHER PLAYER.</b></font>

366
00:16:04,170 --> 00:16:05,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ENDING THE LIFE</b></font>

367
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:08,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji exhales]</b></font>

368
00:16:08,130 --> 00:16:09,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>5: POINTS SHALL BE DESIGNATED
BASED ON THE VALUE</b></font>

369
00:16:09,930 --> 00:16:11,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>THAT THE GAME MASTER
GIVES THEIR LIFE</b></font>

370
00:16:11,430 --> 00:16:14,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Using "fundamentally" in a rule.
Why make it confusing?</b></font>

371
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:16,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Megumi grunts]
-Eh, is something wrong?</b></font>

372
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] It's nothing.</b></font>

373
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:20,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tengen, who is this Game Master?</b></font>

374
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:21,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>GAME MASTER</b></font>

375
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:23,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] Every individual player</b></font>

376
00:16:23,570 --> 00:16:26,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is given a shikigami
called "Kogane."</b></font>

377
00:16:26,820 --> 00:16:30,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To be precise,
Kogane isn't the Game Master.</b></font>

378
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's an interface.</b></font>

379
00:16:31,830 --> 00:16:34,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's best to think of
the Culling Game itself</b></font>

380
00:16:34,830 --> 00:16:36,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as the Game Master.</b></font>

381
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:39,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, I got it.</b></font>

382
00:16:40,210 --> 00:16:41,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>6: BY SPENDING 100 POINTS,
PLAYERS MAY NEGOTIATE</b></font>

383
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:42,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>WITH THE GAME MASTER TO ADD
AN ADDITIONAL RULE</b></font>

384
00:16:42,340 --> 00:16:44,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So we can add, but</b></font>

385
00:16:44,130 --> 00:16:47,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we're not allowed
to eliminate any existing rules.</b></font>

386
00:16:47,050 --> 00:16:48,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji groans]</b></font>

387
00:16:48,630 --> 00:16:51,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe we'll be able to come up
with some kind of workaround.</b></font>

388
00:16:53,010 --> 00:16:55,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>7: THE GAME MASTER MUST APPROVE
ANY ADDITIONAL RULES</b></font>

389
00:16:55,260 --> 00:16:56,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How's that allowed?</b></font>

390
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:58,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, right.</b></font>

391
00:16:58,730 --> 00:17:01,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It leans too heavily
on their own judgment.</b></font>

392
00:17:01,350 --> 00:17:02,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.</b></font>

393
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:04,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should expect
a fair decision</b></font>

394
00:17:04,060 --> 00:17:05,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when it comes to all challenges.</b></font>

395
00:17:05,980 --> 00:17:07,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're already
subjecting the players</b></font>

396
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:09,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to such stringent rules.</b></font>

397
00:17:09,570 --> 00:17:11,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Jujutsu sorcery
would not allow them</b></font>

398
00:17:11,530 --> 00:17:14,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to show more favoritism
towards Kenjaku.</b></font>

399
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>8: PLAYERS WHO DO NOT SHOW
A CHANGE IN POINTS</b></font>

400
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:17,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>WITHIN 19 DAYS SHALL BE
STRIPPED OF THEIR TECHNIQUE.</b></font>

401
00:17:17,790 --> 00:17:19,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So then, does that mean
I'll be killing people again?</b></font>

402
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:21,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe not.</b></font>

403
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:23,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have a few ideas.</b></font>

404
00:17:26,590 --> 00:17:29,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] We've managed to organize
our information for now.</b></font>

405
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:31,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That just leaves the roles
for each of us.</b></font>

406
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>FUTURE ACTIONS</b></font>

407
00:17:33,470 --> 00:17:35,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuki and Choso will remain here.</b></font>

408
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:36,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They'll guard Tengen.</b></font>

409
00:17:36,930 --> 00:17:38,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>CHOSO - YUKI TSUKUMO
GUARD TENGEN</b></font>

410
00:17:38,730 --> 00:17:41,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Meanwhile, I need to return
to the Zen'in house</b></font>

411
00:17:41,190 --> 00:17:42,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to get their cursed tools.</b></font>

412
00:17:43,810 --> 00:17:45,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right after Gojo was sealed,</b></font>

413
00:17:45,360 --> 00:17:47,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Kamo and Zen'in clans
both took their cursed tools</b></font>

414
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:50,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>out of Jujutsu High's
forbidden vault.</b></font>

415
00:17:50,070 --> 00:17:52,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, Megumi's now
the head of the Zen'in clan.</b></font>

416
00:17:52,910 --> 00:17:55,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-I'll explain it to you later.</b></font>

417
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:59,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So we're free to rummage through
the Zen'in's forbidden vault.</b></font>

418
00:17:59,330 --> 00:18:02,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, before that, Tengen?</b></font>

419
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:06,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know what you want.
It's Juzo Kumiya's atelier.</b></font>

420
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, thank you.</b></font>

421
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:10,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once I'm finished,
I'll look for Panda.</b></font>

422
00:18:10,550 --> 00:18:13,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After that, I'll help
deal with the Culling Game.</b></font>

423
00:18:13,220 --> 00:18:14,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And you, Yuta?</b></font>

424
00:18:15,180 --> 00:18:17,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll enter a Colony and
participate in the Culling Game.</b></font>

425
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:18,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The sooner, the better.</b></font>

426
00:18:19,020 --> 00:18:20,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Before Tsumiki and
Fushiguro enter,</b></font>

427
00:18:21,020 --> 00:18:22,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to know as much as I can.</b></font>

428
00:18:22,770 --> 00:18:24,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I'll be
thoroughly prepared.</b></font>

429
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:26,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

430
00:18:27,230 --> 00:18:29,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll mean acting
on my own once again.</b></font>

431
00:18:29,780 --> 00:18:33,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, in order to prevent us
from clashing with each other,</b></font>

432
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:36,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and in case something does
happen to Tsumiki out there,</b></font>

433
00:18:36,570 --> 00:18:38,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll avoid the nearby Colonies.</b></font>

434
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:41,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should be aware
that the Colonies</b></font>

435
00:18:41,290 --> 00:18:42,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>might cut off reception,</b></font>

436
00:18:42,460 --> 00:18:44,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I might be
out of contact for a while.</b></font>

437
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

438
00:18:46,380 --> 00:18:48,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If Sukuna appears
and takes control of me again,</b></font>

439
00:18:48,540 --> 00:18:50,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need you to kill me.</b></font>

440
00:18:50,050 --> 00:18:51,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Having Okkotsu near Itadori
would keep Fushiguro safe,</b></font>

441
00:18:51,510 --> 00:18:52,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it would be more efficient
for Okkotsu to act alone.</b></font>

442
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:54,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[groans]
-Don't worry about that now.</b></font>

443
00:18:55,010 --> 00:18:56,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's gonna be fine.</b></font>

444
00:18:56,260 --> 00:18:58,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If that happens,
you can have him kill you.</b></font>

445
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After I die.</b></font>

446
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:02,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, well, I'm trying
to avoid that situation.</b></font>

447
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maki.</b></font>

448
00:19:05,060 --> 00:19:06,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right.</b></font>

449
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:09,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want you two to meet up
with Kinji like we planned.</b></font>

450
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:10,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kinji?</b></font>

451
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kinji Hakari.</b></font>

452
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The third-year guy
that got suspended.</b></font>

453
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:17,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're shorthanded,
so it's all hands on deck.</b></font>

454
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:19,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do whatever it takes
to recruit him.</b></font>

455
00:19:19,370 --> 00:19:20,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Is he strong, at least?</b></font>

456
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:23,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's a bit erratic,</b></font>

457
00:19:23,250 --> 00:19:26,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but if he gets into it, he can
be even stronger than I am.</b></font>

458
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:27,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That is impossible.</b></font>

459
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>KENJAKU'S OBJECTIVE (ROAD MAP)</b></font>

460
00:19:35,420 --> 00:19:36,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>THE EVOLUTION OF MANKIND
THROUGHOUT ALL JAPAN</b></font>

461
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:38,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>THE CULLING GAME'S OBJECTIVE</b></font>

462
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:42,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ASSIMILATE MANKIND WITH TENGEN</b></font>

463
00:19:42,890 --> 00:19:43,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ITADORI'S FRIENDS' MISSION</b></font>

464
00:19:48,730 --> 00:19:51,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EACH PERSON'S ACTIONS</b></font>

465
00:19:51,570 --> 00:19:53,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>PARTICIPATE IN THE CULLING GAME
REMAIN IN THE TOMBS OF THE STAR</b></font>

466
00:20:06,710 --> 00:20:07,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Choso!</b></font>

467
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna thank you
for all the help.</b></font>

468
00:20:11,630 --> 00:20:13,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't die out there.</b></font>

469
00:20:17,970 --> 00:20:19,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Choso crying]</b></font>

470
00:20:19,890 --> 00:20:22,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Are you really crying?
-[CHOSO] Shh. Shh.</b></font>

471
00:20:28,390 --> 00:20:31,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[yawns]</b></font>

472
00:20:32,690 --> 00:20:35,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, thanks for coming.</b></font>

473
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:38,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[scattered applause]
-[MAN] Takaba!</b></font>

474
00:20:38,570 --> 00:20:41,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How long are you
gonna keep doin' that crap?</b></font>

475
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:43,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cut it out! [sighs]
You're making me depressed.</b></font>

476
00:20:43,830 --> 00:20:45,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The audience too.</b></font>

477
00:20:45,330 --> 00:20:47,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKABA] Yeah, I know.
[sniffles]</b></font>

478
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:49,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] How old are you now?</b></font>

479
00:20:49,870 --> 00:20:51,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>35 years old.</b></font>

480
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:53,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just give it up already!</b></font>

481
00:20:53,090 --> 00:20:55,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our industry,
it's full of late-bloomers</b></font>

482
00:20:55,590 --> 00:20:58,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who suddenly make it big
for no good reason.</b></font>

483
00:20:58,340 --> 00:20:59,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But not a single one</b></font>

484
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:02,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>out of the blue suddenly
actually became funnier!</b></font>

485
00:21:02,970 --> 00:21:04,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They were already funny people</b></font>

486
00:21:04,300 --> 00:21:06,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>waiting patiently
to be discovered.</b></font>

487
00:21:06,970 --> 00:21:08,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That ain't the case for you.</b></font>

488
00:21:09,020 --> 00:21:10,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look what happened to Tokyo.</b></font>

489
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:12,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one's gonna think ill of you.</b></font>

490
00:21:12,190 --> 00:21:14,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go do something
you're actually suited for.</b></font>

491
00:21:14,770 --> 00:21:17,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[door opens, closes]
-[sobbing]</b></font>

492
00:21:18,530 --> 00:21:20,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I always thought
you were kind of funny.</b></font>

493
00:21:20,570 --> 00:21:22,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You always made me laugh.
-Huh?</b></font>

494
00:21:23,780 --> 00:21:24,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You mean it, Ken?</b></font>

495
00:21:25,030 --> 00:21:27,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Both you and him
have the wrong idea.</b></font>

496
00:21:28,290 --> 00:21:31,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are people who ain't funny
that still make it big.</b></font>

497
00:21:35,210 --> 00:21:37,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are they one-gag comics
like me, though?</b></font>

498
00:21:37,090 --> 00:21:38,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Absolutely not.</b></font>

499
00:21:38,590 --> 00:21:41,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are two types of comedians
that manage to stay big.</b></font>

500
00:21:41,930 --> 00:21:44,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Comedians who are always funny,</b></font>

501
00:21:44,050 --> 00:21:45,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and comedians who can go ahead</b></font>

502
00:21:45,390 --> 00:21:48,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and delude themselves
into believing they are.</b></font>

503
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:52,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exhales]</b></font>

504
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:56,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So which type are you?</b></font>

505
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKABA] Well, I'd like to think
I'm 50-50. [chuckles]</b></font>

506
00:21:58,530 --> 00:22:01,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But in actuality, it's probably
a lot closer to 70-30.</b></font>

507
00:22:01,860 --> 00:22:03,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh... [inhales sharply]</b></font>

508
00:22:03,700 --> 00:22:06,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[♪ suspenseful music playing]
-50-50 or 70-30!</b></font>

509
00:22:06,870 --> 00:22:09,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>CULLING GAME PLAYER
FUMIHIKO TAKABA</b></font>

510
00:22:10,330 --> 00:22:12,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

511
00:23:40,960 --> 00:23:43,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MAKI] Mai, let's get started.
-[MAI] Why did you come here?</b></font>

512
00:23:43,340 --> 00:23:45,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] I think I'll bully you
like I used to, remember?</b></font>

513
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:46,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Please do it, Maki.</b></font>

514
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:49,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAI] You are me, and I am you.</b></font>

515
00:23:49,050 --> 00:23:50,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI AND MAI'S MOTHER]
I gave birth to you.</b></font>

516
00:23:50,600 --> 00:23:52,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OGI] Absolutely ridiculous.</b></font>

517
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:53,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAI] Destroy everything.</b></font>

518
00:23:53,890 --> 00:23:54,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>NEXT EPISODE
PERFECT PREPARATION</b></font>

